ve the same half page piece of art.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1559-cryocube","name":"cryocube","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1559_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-09T22:57:54-08:00","id":1184262,"title":"","content":"Page 409, the Humans in the Underworld sidebar, has the text cut off after \u201cother Awakened\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-09T23:13:52-08:00","id":1184266,"title":"","content":"Relayed from an unregistered backer friend:<br /> <br /> <b>p 345:</b> <i>&quot;A group of young wraiths who accidentally blunder into the machinations of one of htese Spectral masterminds may find themselves <b>in for far trouble</b> than they're ready for.&quot;</i> Presumably either &quot;far more trouble&quot; or just &quot;more trouble.&quot;<br /> <b>p 348: </b>Stray carriage return in the Lifesight heading.<br /> <b>p 368:</b> Carriage-return error under sub-heading &quot;A-viking&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":522,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","user":"Stupid Loserman","date":". 02-10-2018, 02:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxp