lishka","name":"Callishka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2317_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"264"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-10T12:58:03-08:00","id":1184492,"title":"","content":"p44 &quot;So a hulking plasmic could go into the forges and emerge as a <b>delicately crafting ring</b>,&quot; <i>crafting </i>should probably be <i>crafted</i>.<br /> p44 &quot;Beyond that, there are plenty of items that wraiths seek to possess. <b>relics </b>and Artifacts are always sought after, sometimes for their usefulness and sometimes merely for aesthetic value or rarity.&quot; Relic should be capitalized.<br /> p47 &quot;Originally created to hold only the most dangerous enemies of the empire, the chains <b>weree</b> long since repurposed and the secret of their manufacture was spread far and wide.&quot; Extra &quot;e&quot; on &quot;were&quot;.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2317,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2317-callishka","user":"Callishka","date":". 02-10-2018, 04:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2317-callishka","name":"Callishka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2317_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"264"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-10T13:42:17-08:00","id":1184508,"title":"","content":"Willpower is still two freebies per dot, whereas most games from Revised onwards reduced this to one per dot. Is that intentional (perhaps due to WP starting at 5)?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reac